menuconfig LIBUKVENUS
	bool "libukvenus: Venus (Vulkan-over-VirtIO-GPU) SUBMIT_3D encoder"
	default n
	select LIBUKVIRTIO_GPU
	help
	  Venus command-stream encoder for Unikraft.  Encodes Vulkan API calls
	  into the Venus wire format (VkCommandTypeEXT) and submits them to the
	  host via the VirtIO-GPU SUBMIT_3D command (capset id 4 / Venus).
	  Provides uk_venus_probe(), uk_venus_context_create(), uk_venus_submit(),
	  uk_venus_ring_*(), and the low-level uk_venus_encode_*() primitives.
	  Full Vulkan/vkmark support still requires Mesa/Venus timeline integration
	  and same-run frame-proof evidence (see README for the claim boundary).
